commit 4b392f20bfac714946d0780daeaa3297e7e71d12
Author: Alain Volmat <alain.volmat@foss.st.com>
Date:   Wed Jan 8 16:30:19 2025 +0100

    libcamera: pipeline: dcmipp: correct main isp decimation handling

    Correct main isp decimation block handling by first looking at
    necessary isp decimation ratio and check if all requested frame
    resolution can thus be achieved with that isp decimation factor.
    Fail rapidly at validate time if not all requested resolution
    can be achieved.

    At configure time, take into account the isp decimation factor to
    properly configure each subdev resolution.

    Signed-off-by: Alain Volmat <alain.volmat@foss.st.com>

